OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny cloud
OL,6,Fand patchy rain over South Down this
OL,7,Fevening soon clearing, otherwise most
OL,8,Fplaces dry with long clear spells
OL,9,Fovernight, just a few showers for
OL,10,Fwestern counties and the north coast.
OL,11,FA colder night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FA largely sunny start
OL,14,Facross the southeast, otherwise a mix
OL,15,Fof sunny spells as showers in the
OL,16,Fnorth and west become occasionally
OL,17,Fheavy and develop more widely.
OL,18,FFreshening northwesterly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
