OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FCloud
OL,6,Fsoon increasing Thursday with
OL,7,Foccasionally heavy rain spreading
OL,8,Feast. The rain clears overnight to
OL,9,Fleave Friday and Saturday with sunny
OL,10,Fspells and increasingly frequent
OL,11,Fheavy, blustery showers.
